  "summary": {
    "text": "Command A Reasoning is Cohere's first reasoning model, a 111B-parameter text model in the Command A family released on 21 August 2025 on the Cohere platform, with open weights for non-commercial research use. It is a hybrid model whose thinking step can be switched on or off with a user-set token budget, and Cohere aims it at agentic tasks and tool use in 23 languages.",
    "sources": [
