  "notes": "Cohere calls it its first reasoning model. Not listed as deprecated on the deprecations page as of 2026-10-01; that page's 2026-04-04 notice lists it among chat alternatives for the retired Aya Expanse 8B and Aya Vision 8B models. The Hugging Face repository was created on 2025-08-12, before launch; not used as a date. The launch post says it powers Cohere's North platform. The docs model page gives 4x H100 for production, the launch post a single H100 or A100 at 128k context."
